[0.001, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[30;3Hn                                                                            \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[29;1H\u001b[0;31;40m»\u001b[30;1H\u001b[0;92;40mLife Boat\u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1H\u001b[0;96;40m  You are within one of the many wooden lifeboats along this side of the ship.  A single thick rope \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1Hsecures the boat to the Titanic.  You can still walk across the steps to the south to get back onto \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1Hthe great ship.  A small red kit is built into the side of the boat, just beside the first bench.\u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1HKKLLAAAAABBLLAAAANNGGGG!!!!!...The Titantic lurches sideways as a teeth-grinding sound rips across t\u001b[30;100H \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1Hthe side of the ship.  You suddenly realize that the ship has struck an iceburg!  Even as you think \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1Hthe huge vessal tilts and studders, sinking lower and lower into the icy black ocean.  Crowds of peo\u001b[30;98H   \u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1Hpeople rush from every exit in a mad panic to escape the danger.\u001b[2;30r\u001b[30;1H\u001bD\u001b[r\u001b[30;1H                                                                                                    \u001b[30;1H\u001b[0;91;40;5m» \u001b[1;1H\u001b[0;97;44m                                                                                                    \u001b[1;4HMove\u001b[1;10H4\u001b[1;88HScore\u001b[1;95H0\u001b[1;41H     Life Boat     \u001b[30;3H\u001b[0;93;40m                                                                             \u001b[30;3H\u001b[?25h"]
